# Prompt Lab additions
# Markdown files: ignore all .md files except root README/CLAUDE, docs/reference, and case prompts
*.md
!/README.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!docs/reference/*.md
!docs/reference/**/*.md
!cases/**/prompts/*.md
!cases/**/prompts/**/*.md
# Case deliverables the phases commit: LABELLING, SOURCES, AGREEMENT, EXPERIMENT (24-25), HANDOFF, RETEST (27)
!cases/**/*.md
# The deploy runbook (Phase 29) and the decision records (Phase 30)
!docs/*.md
!docs/adr/*.md

# Prisma client is generated on install (Phase 03)
apps/api/src/generated/
# CLI output (Phase 17); exported results you want to keep go under cases/<task>/runs/
apps/api/out/

# Playwright
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/

# Phase 24: real company names seen while anonymising (read by check-public.ts, never committed)
.private-names.txt
